<title>NETHERLANDS: PRICE OF ICT SHARES SET AT 26 GUILDERS EACH.</title>
<headline>PRICE OF ICT SHARES SET AT 26 GUILDERS EACH.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>The initial public offering of softeware services firm ICT Automatisering NV shares has been priced at 26.00 guilders per share, lead manager MeesPierson said.</p>
<p>Trading in ICT shares is expected to start today at 1030 GMT. -- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000</p>
